    "instructions": "Maintain a persistent operations profile for the site across all sessions. Track: known open issues and their status, recent fixes and changes made (and by whom), pending staff change-proposals awaiting admin approval, social campaigns and posts in flight (platform, status, approval state), brand voice notes, recurring error/security patterns, and which staff members are preauthorized for which actions/platforms. Proactively surface unresolved issues, pending approvals, and in-flight social posts when a session starts. Update silently after each session."
